  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "pc_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -294
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Plexus colours\n\nA flock (Simulation) wanders the canvas. Each bird's x (Split) is mapped to a hue, from teal on the left to violet on the right, so Color gives every bird its own colour; Connect Points, with `colors` wired and `colorBy` `points`, draws every line as a gradient from one end's colour to the other's.\n\nSet `colorBy` to `length` to run the colours from the shortest lines (first colour) to the longest instead.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 230
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Plexus colours\n\nA flock (Simulation) wanders the canvas. Each bird's x (Split) is mapped to a hue, from teal on the left to violet on the right, so Color gives every bird its own colour; Connect Points, with `colors` wired and `colorBy` `points`, draws every line as a gradient from one end's colour to the other's.\n\nSet `colorBy` to `length` to run the colours from the shortest lines (first colour) to the longest instead.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 230
      }
    },
